# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.env

# Conda environments
env/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# Database — keep local only
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# JSON memory files — keep local only
memory/*.json
*.json

# Model files — too large for GitHub
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.gguf

# Logs
*.log

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.cursor
```

The most important lines:
```
*.db          ← chisato.db never goes to GitHub
memory/*.json ← your personal memory files stay local
*.pth         ← voice model files are too large
*.gguf        ← LLM model files are massive

# GPT-SoVITS — has its own git repo, exclude entirely
Chisato/backend/voice/GPT-SOVITS/